WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.417
An equation says two quantities are equal. Use inverse operations to solve for the

00:00:05.417 --> 00:00:05.789
unknown.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:13.571
Solve x plus 12 equals 42. The answer is 30. x equals 42 minus 12 equals 30.

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:19.981
A box in a recycling club has 24 stickers plus x more; altogether there are 40. What

00:00:19.981 --> 00:00:22.258
is x? Pause the video and think.

00:00:23.117 --> 00:00:29.367
A box in a recycling club has 24 stickers plus x more; altogether there are 40. What

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:34.146
is x? The answer is 16. x equals 40 minus 24 equals 16.
